Subject: [PATCH] Add opencode-go (glm-5.2) AI provider; fix
 scan-main-competitors to generate real adapted scripts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New OpencodeProvider (lib/ai-providers/opencode-provider.ts) calls opencode-go
  directly at https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1 (OpenAI-compatible chat completions).
  Standalone HTTP client with no dependency on Hermes or any other VPS service —
  Hermes just happens to use the same opencode-go endpoint for its own purposes.
  Set as new default script provider.
- Registered in factory.ts, both AIProviderType unions, csv.ts validation,
  api/keys/route.ts, and Settings UI. Credential expected as OPENCODE_API_KEY
  (own key for Content Studio, not shared with Hermes).
- scan-main-competitors/route.ts: replaced hardcoded newConcepts: "" and the
  fabricated "API quota exceeded" fallback with real AI script generation,
  bounded to the top 8 ideas per scan (3 concurrent) to stay under the
  Cloudflare request timeout. Unreached ideas get an honest pending message.
